    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to present for sale this lovely four bedroom detached property situated in a nice quiet cul de sac position in the mature and hugely convenient Waterpark estate in Carrigaline.  \r\n\r\nThe property offers a nice blend of both living and bedroom accommodation throughout with an open plan layout on the ground floor connecting the dining and living room through to the kitchen. It has a downstairs bedroom with an en suite & separate guest WC under the stairs. Upstairs, it has   four spacious bedrooms (1 en-suite) & main bathroom making this a fine family home, consisting of approximately 1,305 sq ft in total. Outside, it has  a nice enclosed rear garden with side access that has a stand alone studio/garden room ideal for those working from home that could easily be converted to an office if required. It also has a Steeltech shed on a concrete base and a nice patio area.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated in a most conveniently positioned, within walking distance of all amenities & services, especially the school & playground in Carrigaline town centre and is just a short commute to Cork Airport, Cork City Centre & Ringaskiddy where a host of multi-national pharmaceutical companies are positioned."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.67m x 1.02m \r\nSolid wooden floor, teak hardwood front door with glazed panel, centre light, glazed door and side panel to Living Room.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.54m x 4.08m \r\nSolid oak wooden floor, multi fuel stove with granite and brick surround, centre light, curtain pole, curtains, double doors to Dining Room.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 4.1m x 2.7m \r\nSolid oak wooden floor, curtain pole, curtains, centre light, double doors to Living Room.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.26m x 2.75m \r\nTile floor, fitted kitchen unit with tile splash back, fluorescent light, door to rear garden, window blinds.\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 2.5m x 2.76m \r\nTile floor, wc, whb with tile surround.\r\n\r\nStudy - 2.91m x 2.28m \r\nWooden floor, window blind, centre light.\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.65m x 2.25m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, walk in electric shower with enclosure, chrome heated towel rail, wc, whb.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.35m x 4.45m \r\nCarpet floor, large built in wardrobe, window blind, centre light.\r\n\r\nEn Suite - 1.5m x 1.8m \r\nVinyl floor, shower unit, wc, whb with underneath storage, centre globe light, wall mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.67m x 3.4m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe, curtain pole, curtains, centre light\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 3.18m \r\nCarpet floor, built in wardrobe, window blind, centre light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.85m x 2.3m \r\nWooden floor, curtain pole, curtains, centre light.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.53m x 2.01m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, bath unit with overhead electric shower, enclosure, wc, whb with underneath storage, window blind, centre light.\r\n\r\nStudio - 3.74m x 5.58m \r\nConcrete floor, timber cladded ceiling, fluorescent lighting suitable for home office.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 121.4 sq metres (1,305 sq ft)\r\nOil Fired Central Heating \r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Composite Door\r\nPrivate rear garden with patio area\r\nDetached self-contained studio/garden room\r\nSteeltech shed\r\nQuiet cul de sac location\r\nSpacious living & bedroom accommodation \r\nExcellent condition throughout\r\nMature residential area\r\nMinutes’ walk to all amenities & services\r\nShort commute to Ringaskiddy, Cork Airport & Cork City Centre"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Cork head in to Carrigaline village.  At the roundabout by the Carrigaline Court Hotel turn left, continue straight through the traffic lights passing the playground on the right-hand side.  Take a left into Waterpark estate, take your first right and the property is indicated by our FOR SALE sign. See Eircode: P43 HK84"
      }
